<title>JAPAN: Iwatsu tumbles due to glum earnings forecast.</title>
<headline>Iwatsu tumbles due to glum earnings forecast.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iwatsu Electric Co Ltd shares fell on Monday afternoon, depressed by a glum earnings forecast revision, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0401 GMT, the shares were down 41 yen at 349, the second-largest percentage loser on the first section of the Tokyo bourse.  </p>
<p>The telecommunications equipment maker said Friday that it revised its parent current forecast to a loss of 700 million yen from a previous forecast of a 1.4 billion yen profit.</p>
